# B-12 · Variants — report

**STATUS: deferred**

Blocker: the card's own precondition ("only if D-2 = two variants") fails. D-2 was resolved by the
user on 2026-10-28 as **(b) one hybrid car** (one Rebel Drop entry, one entity), and §11 of the
backlog already tags the card `B-12 skipped: D-2`. The card's Do-line builds "both entities" and its
Done-line diffs "between variants"; with one entity there is no pair to build or diff, and inventing
a second entity would contradict the user decision (R1). Nothing was faked: no second variant was
written, no `aafdiff` was run against a pair that does not exist, and no value was typed into a
report (R11 — the blocker is re-derived by `Tools/scripts/b12_variants.py --check`).

