   exit 1 caught: FAIL: tmp/b12_tamper/bm_build_variant.py now registers a --variant argument - re-read the card, the Do-line may have become runnable
          FAIL: B-12 is skipped by D-2 - 1 variant (hybrid), 1 entity, 1 drop entry, 0 variant pair(s) to diff
